{%- comment -%}
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
STORY PACK HANDLE (used by sections/story-hero.liquid and sections/story-home-band.liquid)
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Prints the handle of the starter pack that contains a given audiobook, so a story page can offer "this story in a
starter pack" without a pack being picked by hand for every character or book. Capture its output (render inside a
capture), then look the handle up in all_products. Inputs: book (the audiobook product), packs_collection (collection
handle), player_handle (left out of the match).

Looks through the first 60 products of the packs collection, skips the player and anything unavailable, and prints
the first pack whose `bundles.products` list holds the book (packs earlier in the collection win). Prints nothing
when no pack holds it. Same matching rule as the author and narrator pages (sections/person-intro.liquid).
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign found = ''
  if book != blank and packs_collection != blank
    assign pack_collection = collections[packs_collection]
    for candidate in pack_collection.products limit: 60
      if candidate.available == false or candidate.handle == player_handle
        continue
      endif
      for candidate_book in candidate.metafields.bundles.products.value
        if candidate_book.id == book.id
          assign found = candidate.handle
          break
        endif
      endfor
      if found != ''
        break
      endif
    endfor
  endif
  echo found
-%}
